# $apply with mixed int and string keys: int-keyed → positional, string-keyed → named
[
  f: [fn [a b@[default: 99] c] [str a [str b c]]]
  args: [0: "x" c: "z"]
  result: [apply f args]
]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(a, b, c), "args": Dict({0: String("x"), "c": String("z")}), "result": String("x99z")})
=== warn
arity mismatch: expected 3 arguments, got 1 at 1:1-5:2
